{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">金價偏軟，美元走強及債息上升，不利金價表現。現貨金價變動不大，維持在每盎司4,140美元水平。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至於紐約期金，收市報4,156.8美元一盎司，跌5.5美元，跌幅百分之0.13。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T23:19:07.045859+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}